<p>Hello hello <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/damian-thorne" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7106669); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7106669&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609096520" alt="Damian Thorne" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7106669)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/damian-thorne" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7106669); return false;">Damian Thorne</a></span>! Welcome to the Wiki! I'm Ralliston, a site author and a member of the Community Outreach Team - with this helpful little comment, I'll try to help you find your way around the site and link a bunch of useful places and links that will help you in your SCP journey.</p>
<p>Well, keep your secrets to yourself then - regardless though, welcome to the site. I'd really want to say something more, but without your input, I can't really do much here. I'll say this much - I very much hope you enjoy your time here on-site and achieve all of the goals you're aiming for.</p>
<p>Without further ado though, let's click the collapsible, shall we? :)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
